  "description": "Hammond at maximum drive — the tonewheel organ pushed past its linear range, harmonics spilling into distortion. All drawbars at 8, high key click, percussion engaged. CHARACTER at 0.85 — above default toward maximum character. MOVEMENT low (0.2 — the drive does the movement, not the modulation). The Hammond that broke the PA system.",
